The repository contains the rendered cheatsheet in `index.html`, its web assets and scripts, and PDF preparation files. I’m documenting those and calling out an important build detail: `parse.js` reads the root `README.md`, so this overview is not a replacement for the original cheatsheet Markdown source.
Created `README.md` with an overview of the cheatsheet, its topics, repository contents, and helper scripts.

It also documents that `parse.js` reads `README.md` and overwrites `index.html`; running it with this project overview would replace the rendered cheatsheet. No other files were created or changed.

